TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Hı? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Şimdiden mi gidiyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ama misafirperverlik becerilerimi göstermeye
daha fırsat bulamadım sayılır{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Neyse, bari evim hakkında ne düşündüğünü söyle!{{TAG:000F:0001:000000000000}}
Beğendim!
İdare eder.
Biraz uğraş ister.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Hai deciso di tornartene a casa?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Guarda che non c'è nessuna fretta{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Oggi mi sento ospitale!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Speravo in effetti di poter avere
un giudizio su casa mia da
Sua Altezza Reale {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:000F:0001:000000000000}}
Proprio niente male!
Può andare.
Andrebbe migliorata.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}¿De verdad?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ¿Es para tanto?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}
Pues yo pensé que por lo menos
te gustarían los muebles.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bueno, si tú lo dices...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡será verdad!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Tengo que ponerle más empeño!
